; Regression test for issue #3313: a dated P directive reads its
; commodity with the same parser as the commodity directive.  A ';'
; written right after the symbol begins a comment there too, so the
; first price below has no amount; it used to price a commodity named
; "FOO;BAR".  The second line ends with its quoted symbol, so it has no
; amount either, but the parser stepped two characters past the closing
; quote, beyond the end of the line, into what the comment line before
; it had left in the buffer, and priced N1 at 7.77 EUR.

P 2024/01/01 FOO;BAR 10 USD
; xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx7.77 EUR
P 2024/01/01 "N1"

test bal -> 2
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 10:
Error: No quantity specified for amount
While parsing file "$FILE", line 12:
Error: No quantity specified for amount
end test
